<title>GREECE: Delos, International top Greek balanced funds in April.</title>
<headline>Delos, International top Greek balanced funds in April.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delos and International were the top runners among Greece's 16 equity-income funds in April, continuing to lead the race for returns with 53.8 and 38.5 percent respectively, the association of institutional investors said.</p>
<p>Balanced fund assets under management totalled 55.52 billion drachmas, up 36.5 percent since the beginning of the year. They made up only 1.51 percent of the mutual fund industry's assets of 4.95 trillion drachmas in April.</p>
